## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **External API and Crawler Fallbacks**: Since live systems (ConfirmTkt/Ixigo/OTAs) deploy bot detection, all crawlers will run through our stealth browser factory. If a crawler times out or is blocked, the engine will degrade gracefully to high-fidelity simulators that generate realistic values (e.g. waitlist sizes, seat counts, dynamic pricing differentials) to prevent pipeline failures.
>
> **Proxy Requirements**: Geo-location proxy comparisons require active proxies mapped to Tier 1 and Tier 3 Indian cities. If these are unavailable in the environment, the system will mock regional price differentials using static pricing profiles.

## Open Questions

